[18.642, "o", "miu-cr: 04:02:50.299 done: 1 findings\r\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1m✖ CRITICAL (security)\u001b[0m  \u001b[36mapi/admin.go:8-9\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    Removing the `return` makes `Admin` fall through to `w.Write([]byte(secretReport()))` after writing the 403, so any non-admin caller receives the full secret report body despite the forbidden status. This defeats the `isAdmin` authorization check the doc comment promises (\"serves the internal report to admins only\").\r\n  \u001b[2mcode:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ http.Error(w, \"forbidden\", http.StatusForbidden)\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[2msuggested patch:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[2m│ \t\thttp.Error(w, \"forbidden\", http.StatusForbidden)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[2m│ \t\treturn\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t}\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n1 finding(s):\r\n  critical 1\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "exit=2\r\n"]
[6.017, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m# 3. every review is saved\u001b[0m\r\n"]
